# ============================================================
# Xcode build output (generated by Unity — safe to delete,
# regenerated via File > Build > Append into xcode_build/)
# Track: .xcodeproj, Info.plist, launch screens, source stubs
# Ignore: large compiled/binary directories
# ============================================================
xcode_build/Data/
xcode_build/Frameworks/
xcode_build/Classes/
xcode_build/Il2CppOutputProject/
xcode_build/Il2CppTempDirArtifacts/
xcode_build/Libraries/
xcode_build/unity_BurstDebugInformation_DoNotShip/
xcode_build/Unity-iPhone.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj

